# Netlify _redirects — SEO-friendly URL handling

# Force apex (no www) — prevents duplicate content SEO penalties
https://www.drpbuildlab.com/*    https://drpbuildlab.com/:splat    301!

# Canonicalise the one real HTML page. A wildcard /*.html rule here also
# caught /404.html, which the catch-all below then rewrote straight back.
/index.html    /    301!

# Legacy anchors (in case old links still point here)
/pakketten    /#diensten    301
/pakket       /#diensten    301
/prijzen      /#diensten    301
/pricing      /#diensten    301

# Catch-all 404 (must be last)
/*    /404.html    404
